nd Richter the medalists were the same as in the 100 backstroke, with Treiber getting silver and Garapick bronze. Belote and Stille never challenged and finished 5-6, while Hogg struggled on the final 100 and placed eighth and last in the final. Even Richter was surprised by her second backstroke gold, “Quite frankly, I didn’t expect to win the 200 back.”"] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "R1"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "112"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/47525"} "Ulrike Richter"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GDR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GDR.png"}] "GDR"]] [:td {} "2:17.58 (1 h3)"] [:td {} "2:13.43 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "–"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/47550"} "Birgit Treiber"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GDR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GDR.png"}] "GDR"]] [:td {} "2:17.62 (1 h4)"] [:td {} "2:14.97 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "43"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/45791"} "Nancy Garapick"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/CAN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/CAN.png"}] "CAN"]] [:td {} "2:16.49 (1 h1)"] [:td {} "2:15.60 (3)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "4"] [:td {:class "bib"} "213"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/50749"} "Nadezhda Stavko"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/URS"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; verti